   Lin, Chih-Cheng, Natl Kaohsiung Univ Sci \& Technol, Ctr Marine Affairs Studies, Dept Fisheries Technol \& Management, Kaohsiung, Taiwan.
   Chiang, I-Chun, Natl Kaohsiung Univ Sci \& Technol, Dept Business Comp, Kaohsiung, Taiwan.},
